{"logId": "d0a316be-0558-4c78-b877-79d0dd2e88b2", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [121, 90, 193, 128], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 90.0], [193.0, 90.0], [193.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、警惕有人频翻行李。一些不法分子会携带大行李袋或与旅客相同的行李袋上车，并放在一起，在旅途中频频爬上行李架假装取自己的东西，借机翻动旅客行李行窃。因此，上车摆放行李时要避免形状与颜色相同的行李放在一起以免下车时拿错。", "block_bbox": [99, 170, 783, 304], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[99.0, 170.0], [783.0, 170.0], [783.0, 304.0], [99.0, 304.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、夜间瞌睡别忘行李。当列车进入夜间行车时，硬座车厢的旅客往往打起瞌睡。此时不法分子往往借机行事，找机会下手。若是老乡或亲友同行，应采取分时睡觉，留一人看护行李。如单身旅行，可与同座位的旅客互相提醒。", "block_bbox": [100, 311, 783, 411], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[100.0, 311.0], [783.0, 311.0], [783.0, 411.0], [100.0, 411.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、防人之心不可缺少。一些不法分子会利用“老乡”、“同行”等借口主动搭讪，或主动赠送食品及物品，在你放松警惕时实施诈骗和盗窃。旅途中，不要将自己的行李物品交给不认识或认识不久的人看管。不要吃喝不认识或认识不久的人赠送的饮料或食品。", "block_bbox": [99, 419, 783, 554], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[99.0, 419.0], [783.0, 419.0], [783.0, 554.0], [99.0, 554.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [790, 186, 1074, 353], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[790.0, 186.0], [1074.0, 186.0], [1074.0, 353.0], [790.0, 353.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [796, 389, 1072, 567], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[796.0, 389.0], [1072.0, 389.0], [1072.0, 567.0], [796.0, 567.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DL", "block_bbox": [120, 708, 192, 743], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[120.0, 708.0], [192.0, 708.0], [192.0, 743.0], [120.0, 743.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "住宿注意事项：", "block_bbox": [166, 784, 335, 813], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 784.0], [335.0, 784.0], [335.0, 813.0], [166.0, 813.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、应首先选择选择正规的酒店。", "block_bbox": [142, 822, 451, 850], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[142.0, 822.0], [451.0, 822.0], [451.0, 850.0], [142.0, 850.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、选择那些治安环境好非住宿人员不能随意进入，能够保证人身和财产安全的宾馆（饭店）。", "block_bbox": [141, 864, 677, 921], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[141.0, 864.0], [677.0, 864.0], [677.0, 921.0], [141.0, 921.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、入住前，应确认宾馆（饭店）具有完善的消防设施及安全通道。", "block_bbox": [141, 934, 678, 990], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[141.0, 934.0], [678.0, 934.0], [678.0, 990.0], [141.0, 990.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、进入房间时，首先认真阅读宾馆（饭店）消防逃生图，了解所在位置的逃生路线及逃生通道门能从楼道内打开。", "block_bbox": [141, 1004, 691, 1060], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[141.0, 1004.0], [691.0, 1004.0], [691.0, 1060.0], [141.0, 1060.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、应遵守宾馆（饭店）的安全要求", "block_bbox": [142, 1073, 487, 1101], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[142.0, 1073.0], [487.0, 1073.0], [487.0, 1101.0], [142.0, 1101.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、不要将自己住宿的酒店、房号随便告诉陌生人。", "block_bbox": [142, 1103, 623, 1131], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[142.0, 1103.0], [623.0, 1103.0], [623.0, 1131.0], [142.0, 1131.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [720, 819, 1016, 983], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[720.0, 819.0], [1016.0, 819.0], [1016.0, 983.0], [720.0, 983.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [707, 1021, 1003, 1172], "block_id": 15, "block_order": null, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[707.0, 1021.0], [1003.0, 1021.0], [1003.0, 1172.0], [707.0, 1172.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 1213, 1122, 1256], "block_id": 16, "block_order": null, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 1213.0], [1122.0, 1213.0], [1122.0, 1256.0], [939.0, 1256.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.51758873462677, "coordinate": [121, 90, 193, 128], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[121.0, 90.0], [193.0, 90.0], [193.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9443199038505554, "coordinate": [99, 170, 783, 304], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[99.0, 170.0], [783.0, 170.0], [783.0, 304.0], [99.0, 304.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9423649907112122, "coordinate": [100, 311, 783, 411], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[100.0, 311.0], [783.0, 311.0], [783.0, 411.0], [100.0, 411.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9478659629821777, "coordinate": [99, 419, 783, 554], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[99.0, 419.0], [783.0, 419.0], [783.0, 554.0], [99.0, 554.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9217120409011841, "coordinate": [790, 186, 1074, 353], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[790.0, 186.0], [1074.0, 186.0], [1074.0, 353.0], [790.0, 353.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9047020077705383